      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LOST DRAGON (6) stalked the pace from a low draw last start and fought on well to finish 1.5 lengths away in second (20.28) at this track in a Mix 5 over 366m. Expected to feature in the finish again. DRINK MICKEYS (8) has missed the frame at his last two but did run well three back when third (16.76) in a Mix 5 at Q Straight. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from on outside draw. Key player on best and worth another try. MAN ON FIRE (1) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 2.75 lengths at Q Lakeside in a handy 21.75 beating Legs Eleven. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Expected to measure up again. ICE RIDER (2) with some luck can improve on an unplaced run last time here.",
